    },
    {
        "text": "Sarkaz...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_053"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, you! Eyes on that Caster... watch her! Don't let her try anything!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "text": "Kill them all already! Quick!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right! Right! Kill 'em, kill 'em all!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(Columbian-Victorian) You want to kill me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're all blind to it! You've all got Ursus chains on your necks!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rosmontis, this isn't worth it! They've pretty much lost their minds! Let's move out of this block, find a different breach point!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis Squadmember"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Bowguns up! Bowguns up... blow it off! Blow her head off! You're like that bunny who was just here... you're like her!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042"
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya didn't go this way because she didn't want to do things like I do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2"
    },
    {
        "text": "The hell are you all staring like that for? You're an Infected, you're an Infected! Why're you all staring at me like that? !",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Infected"
    },
    {
        "text": "Collaborators? Trying to make it home? Like hell, hahah, like bleeding hell! Ursus can't defeat us! We've won! Won!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Infected"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fire! Fire at her, at her!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042"
    },
    {
        "text": "No point.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
