    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042"
    },
    {
        "text": "No point. I don't want you to hurt me, so there's nothing you can do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2"
    },
    {
        "text": "What the hell... what the hell?! Keep firing! Keep firing! Blow the whole place out!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Infected"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is that a wall? What kind of Arts... what the hell kind of\u2014! The bolts are all breaking against it! They're breaking!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_053"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stop attacking those wall things, it's useless! Just looking at 'em tells you they won't budge! Call the Casters in!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2"
    },
    {
        "text": "The hell do you know?! We're attacking her face-on!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Infected"
    },
    {
        "text": "But before the arrows can reach her, and before the shrapnel can strike her face, they hit something! Some kind of invisible wall or something, whatever the hell! They just shatter! They can't get in!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Infected"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stupid goddamn Caster! We'll see how long you hold out... how much have you even got?! You can't keep this up for long, we'll see how long you hold out!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Infected"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why, why... can you not just hit her? She's not doing a damn thing! The hell are your ballistas, huh? The hell are your empowered crossbows?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Infected"
    },
    {
        "text": "Bombard her, blow her to kingdom come! Blow her to smithereens! Blow her up like all those goddamned Ursus, and then make her tonight's stew!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is the Rosmontis Squad, Amiya! We're through to you... talk her down! You need to talk her down!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis Squadmember"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rosmontis, listen to the comms!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis Squadmember"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2"
    },
    {
        "text": "All you uniforms! Ahah! All you uniforms, we'll hang you, dry you on the power lines, let the rottenfeathers peck you apart!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Infected"
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll let you know! Know what you get for looking down on us!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Infected"
    },
    {
        "text": "Looking down on us, beating us, giving us those looks. Hahah\u2014gack\u2014we'll kill you all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Infected"
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll throw you all into an engine, drr-dr-dr-dr-dr-dr-dr, and watch the minced meat come out, hahahahahah...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_053"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you DOING? What are you prancing about for?! Don't expose your squad's position!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't waste your breath... goddamn devil! Hard-horned brute! What makes you think you can order ME?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Infected"
    },
    {
        "text": "You think you're Talulah? You think you're that undying goddamn beast? Whoopsie, he's already done for! Bang!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Infected"
    },
    {
        "text": "You'll all be done for! Us Ursus Infected'll... kill you! Kill the lot of you! You're all\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$fightgeneral"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "And the Sarkaz kicks the Infected straight out of the window."
    },
    {
        "text": "The Infected howls, or perhaps it's more of a laugh, as he falls from the seventh floor to the ground, and is immediately obliterated by the ballistas."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_053"
    },
    {
        "text": "*Spit*.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do it. Bring out the big guns. Kill 'em dead.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042"
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya, can you hear me? We're taking the route we agreed. Out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rosmontis...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis Squadmember"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_chercen_2",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
