        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are the guerrillas' current movements?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012"
    },
    {
        "text": "By our recon Operators' reports, the already-assembled guerrillas are currently in Central Main Street, openly attacking other Reunion guards.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's also a few small guerrilla squads opting to retreat instead, and they're scattering across every part of the city...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...I see. The guerrillas still have other obligations.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "But our two teams are already too occupied to account for the situation anywhere else in the Core City.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "The longer it takes to break through the blockade, the less time we'll have left.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "If the other anti-guerrilla Infected are kept pinned down by the guerrillas, we'll be able to reach the command tower much faster. We can't waste this opportunity.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll leave controlling the overall situation to Raidian and Mantra's judgment. As for controlling the battlefield...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I and Rosmontis both need more space to think.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "But. Rosmontis...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "After we rule out any ambush interference, we're still guaranteed other roundabout routes. But Rosmontis, I think, more or less can only choose to eliminate obstacles in front of her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "More or less. That's how she's already done things.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Oh.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dr. Kal'tsit was on the mark. We're in one heck of a mess.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "Reunion has already fallen apart, seeing as their infighting is killing them faster than the guerrilla attacks are.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "They usually have enough friction of their own, but then Patriot died, and that news blew up, and now everything's gone haywire.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "With all the devastation the whole way here, I'm hard-pressed to say they're that united anymore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Notify the other team members to assemble. Have the Casters bring the drones back in. We're going to converge with Rosmontis.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_chercen_2",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_042",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, Amiya.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "text": "Everything's dealt with here now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "...We...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis Squadmember"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry, Amiya. There had to be a better way we could've done this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis Squadmember"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's how I wanted to do it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "text": "Negotiations falling through isn't a problem. The way they are, it's impossible to communicate.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "text": "And they're doing bad things. If I left them alone, they'd just do even more bad things.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012"
    },
    {
        "text": "An entire building... you took an entire building...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Did I go too far?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No, no. Just, I've just never been on a mission with you before. Seeing it for myself is a shocker.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "You really are the ace up Rhodes Island's sleeve. Our strongest war machine...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Um.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Amiya, did I say something wrong?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "initr": 2,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_bridge",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "cameraeffect",
        "effect": "Grayscale",
        "keep": true,
        "amount": 1,
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "The evening before the core city Operation Team's departure from the ship"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I won't allow it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Dr. Kal'tsit. This time, I'm going to have to do it this way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We've gone over this question countless times before, Amiya.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your Originium Arts expend your physical strength. This goes even as far as the physiological activity your metabolism requires.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your life is... passing. You're not a machine, nor a ship's cannon. You cannot have your parts changed, nor can you be further processed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No. Maybe you still don't know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "...There'd be another memory from far too long ago. I'm not certain how much pressure it would bring about on your body.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Every simulation's result is leagues from anything ideal. I can rule out this choice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Then how about this, Dr. Kal'tsit. Let me put it this way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "This time, I need to do things this way. I'll be taking off one more ring.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya, we are going over a form of violence. You have said as much to me. If you didn't want me to stop you here and now, then you wouldn't have asked me to swear it to you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Chairman and I cast these rings together. It was so that no-one who came after would easily walk that path again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm using them, Dr. Kal'tsit. I won't argue for weapons, and I would never say that any kind is better for its ability to kill faster.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "However, what Miss Theresa left to me was not the same thing at all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Since the very beginning, perhaps they were never designed as weapons.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "They shouldn't be used to kill anyone... they never should. When they're used, what I think of is who I should save.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is the conclusion I've come to, after years of coexisting with them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Trusting a kind of weapon is not in any way a wise act.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you wish to use them as a surgical tool and not as a lethal weapon, then you must be in control of their blade.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "A blade is a blade to both the enemy and me, no matter how you use it. Its characteristics will not change.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya... they will incise you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Dr. Kal'tsit, I'm not afraid.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wounds can heal.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But they can leave behind scars. Scars that nobody can bear to look at.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Mngh.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "But I... I won't give up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Originium has already changed my body in ways you know. Any further wounds... they'd be one or two wounds, and nothing more.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I am not a weapon.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you need me to bring up another hurtful example?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014What case?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Who can prove that you and I are not a kind of weapon?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who can come to define whether or not we are a kind of weapon?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Can weapons think? Are weapons that can think all the more fearsome? Are weapons with self-awareness automatically no longer a kind of weapon?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, Amiya. I disagree.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even if I know\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "initr": 2,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "You've already grown up."
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't stop you."
    },
    {
        "text": "Your decisions are yours to make."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "initr": 2,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
