        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_chercen_2",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "cameraeffect",
        "effect": "Grayscale",
        "keep": true,
        "amount": 0,
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, Operator. You've misspoken.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Have you ever seen, um... such a...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "...cute...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "...weapon... before?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Um. No, not that I'm saying...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042"
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya... is cuter.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "S\u2014Sorry! I can't think of... I can't think of another way to put it...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're people. People, with a full complement of emotions.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "After this is over, find the chance to apologize to her, okay?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_042",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't, don't, Amiya. It's okay.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's go. Together.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_042",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, wait, Rosmontis... I think I might fall here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_042",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm going to hold on tight to you. I can't let those guys, those Infected. I can't let them hurt you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_042",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "A little slower... let's go a little slower, okay?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Maybe i shouldn't have said it like that. But...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Hm...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
