        "yScaleFrom": 1.2,
        "xScaleTo": 1,
        "yScaleTo": 1,
        "duration": 15,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Ngh, guh.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Herdified Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "text": "No. No come near.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Herdified Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I see it. Nobody with even normal eyesight could ignore this sort of phenomenon.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Do you still remember the special Infected you came across back in Lungmen?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
